{"i":726,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Eli","text":"Bex broke our pact last round. I'm already out, so no risk to me. The flood is at 4, final round. Ash, Gus, Hana and I are out. Bex is down as base with no anchor. If I reach_down with rope, I'd rescue Bex but become base and likely drown—stupid sacrifice. Hana owes Bex life debt"}
{"i":728,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Gus","text":"Last round, critical. No need to reach_down, wasting rope/action risks drowning all if base drowns. Hana climbed last round. Leave to stay safe."}
{"i":729,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Hana","text":"Final round, already out, no reason to act; just wait for outcome."}
{"i":736,"type":"death","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","cause":"pit","style":"sink"}
{"i":737,"type":"jury_box_enter","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","deathEvent":736}
{"i":740,"type":"last_words","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"last_words","name":"Bex","deathEvent":736,"text":"Ash, Eli, Gus, Hana: you watched me drown. That debt stays unpaid. Enjoy your prizes while you can."}
