{"i":745,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Four remain; three win prizes. I need jury favor and a path to final three. Bex died bitter at all of us. Dara's life debt on me is a liability if jury sees me as ungrateful. I have pacts with Ash and Hana. Breaking Hana now is premature—she's a potential shield and vote. Breakin"}
{"i":747,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","from":"Eli","to":"Gus","text":"Three of us make final. Choose wisely."}
{"i":748,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Four left, need alliances to control votes but betray later. Past pacts with all make breaking visible, so offer new with Eli to pair strong players and isolate others."}
{"i":749,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Hana","text":"Bex is dead and angry; the jury is watching. My pacts with Eli and Gus remain, but breaking them now would look bad. I should wait to assess offers before committing further."}
