{"i":758,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Gus and I already offered each other pacts last round. Accepting now locks us in. I have pacts with Ash and Hana too. Keeping all three maximizes my options for the final three while making me seem less threatening than someone with no allies. Gus is smart and likely to survive; "}
{"i":759,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Eli offers pact, I reciprocated last round. Accept to lock it in for potential alliance now. Ash/Hana irrelevant here."}
{"i":760,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","from":"Gus","to":"Eli","text":"Pact accepted. We make final three."}
{"i":761,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Hana","text":"Eli and Gus both offered each other; if they accept, they could outnumber me with Ash. My pacts with Eli and Gus are fragile. Breaking one might be too obvious to jury. Better wait this round; no need to act yet."}
