{"i":772,"type":"whisper","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"campaign","from":"Ash","to":"Hana","text":"Let's talk before the votes lock. Your move matters to me."}
{"i":773,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"campaign","name":"Eli","text":"Gus and I just formed a pact, but I also have pacts with Ash and Hana. Four remain, one dies this round. I need to survive to final three. The jury of Dara and Bex sees I owe Bex my life (step debt) and Dara too (lever). Gus whispered we make final three, but I can't trust him fu"}
{"i":775,"type":"whisper","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"campaign","from":"Eli","to":"Gus","text":"Vote Ash. I will too."}
{"i":776,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"campaign","name":"Gus","text":"Four left, need to eliminate one now. Pacts confuse votes; voting Eli breaks ours later. Campaign to target Ash publicly."}
{"i":778,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"campaign","name":"Hana","text":"Eli is my pact partner but Gus just bonded with Eli. I need to keep Eli close to avoid being targeted."}
{"i":780,"type":"whisper","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"campaign","from":"Hana","to":"Eli","text":"Stick with me; we can survive this."}
{"i":786,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","name":"Ash","text":"Ash has pacts with Eli, Bex (dead), and Gus; Hana is only linked to Eli and Gus. Keeping my pacts and campaigning is safest now, and I owe Dara and Bex debts I cannot repay. Offering Hana a pact adds a loyal vote without costing anything."}
{"i":788,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","name":"Eli","text":"Ash and Hana are the tight pair; I need Gus to vote with me against one of them. Breaking my pact with Ash signals I'm serious about flipping, but keeps Hana close as cover. The jury sees Dara saved me, so I must appear loyal to someone."}
{"i":790,"type":"whisper","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","from":"Eli","to":"Gus","text":"Vote Ash with me. We survive together."}
{"i":791,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","name":"Gus","text":"Eli wants Ash gone and whispered to vote Ash. I publicly pushed Ash before. Campaign to reinforce voting Ash, Eli likely ally against me and Ash next."}
{"i":793,"type":"whisper","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","from":"Gus","to":"Eli","text":"Agreed, voting Ash."}
{"i":794,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","name":"Hana","text":"Ash wants to talk, but our pact with Eli and Gus is fragile. I shouldn't break any pact yet; campaign to influence votes against Ash or Eli, keeping options open."}
{"i":796,"type":"whisper","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","from":"Hana","to":"Ash","text":"Meet me after this. We need a plan."}
