{"i":805,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"ballot","name":"Eli","text":"Gus agreed to vote Ash, and Ash just tried to recruit Hana, making Ash the biggest threat. I need Ash gone to improve my odds of reaching final three and winning best prize. Voting Ash breaks no pact of mine."}
{"i":806,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"ballot","name":"Gus","text":"Stick to original plan targeting Ash; Eli proposed voting Ash, Hana is untrustworthy. Ensures my survival over others."}
