{"i":828,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Hana","text":"Gus voted Ash while having pacts with him, showing betrayal. I have pacts with Eli and Gus; keeping both might be risky. Eli and I are closer, but breaking with Gus could anger jury. I will wait and see offers before committing further."}
