{"i":835,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Only three of us left. Pacts don't matter post-pacts stage. No need to offer or break now; preserve jury perception as reliable."}
{"i":836,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Hana","text":"Current pacts are defensive; no urgent need to change. The vote already eliminated Ash, so remaining threats are Eli and Gus. I am in pact with both, which keeps options open. Waiting is safest."}
